	(text "================================\n           J1 11-PIN EXPANSION PORT NOTES\n================================\nPINOUT MAPPING:\n- P1: GND       | P7:  MISO (IO14) [SPI Shared]\n- P2: 3V3       | P8:  SCK  (IO12) [SPI Shared]\n- P3: 5V (VBUS) | P9:  CS1  (IO15) [Dedicated]\n- P4: SDA (IO7) | P10: IRQ  (IO16) [Dedicated]\n- P5: SCL (IO6) | P11: TX   (IO8)  [Dedicated]\n- P6: MOSI(IO13)\n\nDESIGN & COEXISTENCE RULES:\n- SPI: Shares MOSI/SCK with display.\n- Separate CS pins keep signals isolated.\n- Display CS is IO10. Header CS is IO15.\n- I2C: Shares SDA/SCL with keypad expander.\n- Mainboard requires 4.7kΩ pull-ups on IO6/IO7.\n- Safe Boot: Bypasses all strapping pins.\n================================"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 248.666 71.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.381 0.381)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "f3013d1f-61c7-452b-8599-8a27579ef906")
	)
